Subject: Cut out the subject in a video clip (FL-639)

The clip is drawn through a subject matte the server made (SAM2.1 video on this
server or a home computer), with a blurred, removed (see-through), coloured or
photo background, in preview and export. The Edit inspector card finds the
subject, sets the background and edge softness, paints Add to subject / Take
away on the viewer and removes the cut-out.

Upstream Freecut source remains MIT licensed; this adaptation retains that license.
The immutable vendor snapshot is unchanged.

